Design a menu‑driven program using a class FlightReservation to manage flight ticket bookings. The system should allow the following operations:

Add Flight
Add a new flight with details like flight number, destination, and total available seats.

***Display Flights
Show all flights currently available along with their seat counts and destinations.

Book Ticket
Allow a passenger to book a ticket for a flight. Reduce the seat count when booked.

Cancel Ticket
Cancel a previously booked ticket and increase the seat count.

***Search Flight
Search for a flight by flight number or destination and display its availability.

Exit
Terminate the program.